金輪際現れない 一番星の生まれ変わり
Unrivaled, will not appear again, it's the brightest star reborn, yes, indeed

501
00:47:55,408 --> 00:48:00,408
その笑顔で愛してるで 誰も彼も虜にしていく
Using that smiling face, that "I love you" again, now, everybody is lured and captivated by you

502
00:48:00,908 --> 00:48:06,208
その瞳がその言葉が 嘘でもそれは完全なアイ
The pupil that you got, the words you vocalize, even when untrue, it's your perfected ai

