誰よりも強い君以外は認めない
I won't allow anyone if it's not you, strongest of all

508
00:48:35,408 --> 00:48:40,408
誰もが信じ崇めてる まさに最強で無敵のアイドル
That emotion seized all hearts, worshipping you, yes, indeed, so strong, it's you, unrivaled idol

509
00:48:41,408 --> 00:48:46,908
弱点なんて見当たらない 一番星を宿している 弱いところなんて見せちゃダメダメ
There cannot be weaknesses to find, the brightest star is residing in you, the gaps and shortcomings don't show 'em, dammit, dammit

510
00:48:47,408 --> 00:48:52,408
知られたくないところは見せずに 唯一無二じゃなくちゃイヤイヤ
Parts nobody wants to know should remain hidden, one and only, if it's different, no way, no way

511
00:48:52,908 --> 00:48:56,408
それこそ本物のアイ
Such a true love, it's the realest ai

512
00:48:58,408 --> 00:49:01,908
得意の笑顔で沸かすメディア 隠しきるこの秘密だけは
Showing this smile, my own weapon boiling media, keeping everything about my secret deep inside

513
00:49:01,908 --> 00:49:05,408
愛してるって嘘で積むキャリア これこそ私なりの愛だ
"I'm in love with you", my career is built on such a lie, it's the way i know to show my love, without a doubt

514
00:49:11,408 --> 00:49:14,408
流れる汗も綺麗なアクア ルビーを隠したこの瞼
Running down, my sweat is flowing, cleanest aqua, right? Ruby hidden under my eyelids, where it resides

515
00:49:17,408 --> 00:49:20,908
歌い踊り舞う私はマリア そう嘘は飛び切りの愛だ
I sing, and dance around, look at me, i'm maria, so lying surely is the greatest kind of love

516
00:49:25,408 --> 00:49:31,408
誰かに愛されたことも 誰かのこと愛したこともない
I recall no one that loved me whole before, and i've not been in love with anybody before

517
00:49:32,408 --> 00:49:36,908
そんな私の嘘が いつか本当にになること 信じてる
Now the lies i'm making up, i'm hoping that a day comes when they all become true, I keep believing

518
00:49:39,408 --> 00:49:44,908
いつかきっと全部手に入れる 私はそう欲張りなアイドル
One day, i will hold everything that i pursue, yes, i am so greedy, true voracious idol

519
00:49:45,408 --> 00:49:50,908
等身大でみんなのことちゃんと愛したいから
So sincerely, what i'm wishing for is to love each of you with all my heart

520
00:49:51,408 --> 00:49:55,908
今日も嘘をつくの この言葉がいつか本当に鳴る日を願って
And so today, I lie again, I'm wishing that one day these words become true

521
00:49:57,408 --> 00:50:01,408
それでもまだ君と君にだけは言えずにいたけど
Up to this day, I've not been able to let you and you hear me saying those meaningful words...

522
00:50:02,883 --> 00:50:03,933
無敵の笑顔で荒らすメディア
With your invincible smile you stir up the media,

523
00:50:03,933 --> 00:50:05,473
知りたいその秘密ミステリアス
I wanna know that secret, it's so mysterious.

524
